## Product / research invariants

- Maximize visible film style under a hard severe-artifact veto
- Style-safe path is non-generative; ML may predict bounded explicit parameters only; never emit final RGB from a generator
- `film_stock_id` is the top expert class; roll/process/scanner/source/content are nested controls
- Historical/unknown-stock never counts as named-stock coverage
- Do not shortcut stock signal via content, scene colour, source, geometry, exposure, era or filename
- Community pixels / operator fitting / training / LSM remain closed until evidence, rights, connectivity, identifiability, group split and leakage gates pass
- RF2.S0 archive-matrix transplant stays closed; RF2.C0 spektrafilm is Look Approximation control only
- FilmStyleSafe current U4/owner/RF2.C0/ID11 evidence is A0-only; never upgrade to hidden confirmation or population preference
