## Execution loop

After every verified leaf: update evidence → propagate → scoped commit → push (authorized) → refresh Goal state → select next legal ready leaf → continue.

Never stop merely because a plan, harness, commit, test suite, failed data source or rejected candidate finished.

## Stop / authority

Auto-continue via the project `stop` hook while Goal `status=ACTIVE` and `needs_human_authority=false`.

True stops only for: user pause; unresolved parallel writer conflict; unauthorized R3 (paid GPU/archive, merge/release/deploy, purchase, recruiting, license decision, secrets/billing, public messaging); live process kill without approval; or the entire Ultimate parent DoD is truly met.

Merge/release/deploy remain unauthorized. Scoped push on the active research branch is authorized.

## Session end report

If Goal remains `ACTIVE`, do not say the Goal is complete. Report `GOAL ACTIVE` with node, leaf, evidence, commit, push, tests, dirty files, processes, `next_action`, and authority flags. If the stop-loop cap ends the session, last line must be `GOAL_ACTIVE_REQUIRES_NEXT_INVOCATION`.
